   The Simulation Setup Agent will consume the cleaned PDB files produced above and build a complete GROMACS simulation system. The agent will perform the following tasks:

   1. **Ligand Parameter Generation** – The agent will call `generate_ligand_parameters` with the ATP ligand file.  
